  "prefLabel": "Env-WC 103.01 Office Hours and Location",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WC 103.01 Office Hours and Location.\n\n(a) The council’s office shall be located at the Department of Environmental Services, 29 Hazen Drive, P.O. Box 95, Concord, N.H. 03302-0095.\n\n(b) The council’s office shall be open to the public on weekdays, excluding state holidays, from 8:00 A.M. to 4:00 P.M.\n\nSource. #8976, eff 9-14-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wc100.html"
